      "title": "Help: ENGINE: Wan 2.2",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## ENGINE: Wan 2.2\nVideo generation engine (Wan 2.2 i2v, 14B, fp8, two-pass high/low noise).\n- **Infinite Movie · Engine Start** (from Director): `start_image`, `end_image`, `prompt`, `seed`, `width`, `height`, `length`.\n- **UNETLoader** (×2): high-noise and low-noise 14B models.\n- **LoraLoaderModelOnly** (×2): LightX2V distill LoRAs (1022) – run at 8 steps (4 high + 4 low, cfg 1).\n- **WanFirstLastFrameToVideo**: builds conditioning from start/end frames.\n- **KSamplerAdvanced** (×2): two-pass sampling, 8 steps: high-noise 0–4 → low-noise 4–8.\n- **VAEDecode**: decodes the latent to pixels.\n- **Infinite Movie · Engine Result** (to Director): outputs the rendered frames.\n- Copy this group into Infinite Movie (Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V) and mute the MiniMax group (Ctrl+M) – only ONE engine group may be active."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
